# License Notice

This file is a local compatibility placeholder for copied repository patterns that expect a root `LICENSE` file.

## Important Distinction

- This folder contains original curriculum writing plus links to third-party public sources.
- External documents, manuals, standards, and course materials retain their own licensing and attribution requirements.

## Use This File As

- a local landing point so app navigation does not break
- a reminder to respect source-specific terms when reusing external material
